join Lebo (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Lebo (Warm)
Lebo: Right. The mill. I've been thinking about the mill.
- You've been thinking about the mill for three seasons
	Hope: You've been thinking about the mill for three seasons.
	Lebo: I have! And now I think it's actually possible, which is new.
	Lebo: Crankshaft and grinding plate. Both have to be found, neither can be made — I've been over that about nine times.
	Lebo: Two places worth looking. Dumi knows everybody between here and Tzaneen, and Petrus has got a yard full of things that used to be other things.
	- I'll ask them both
		Hope: I'll ask them both.
		Lebo: Don't just ask. Neither of them works like that.
		Lebo: Dumi'll want to think about who to phone and then he'll want you to go and see somebody. And Petrus — Petrus will make you move about forty years of tarpaulin.
	set {GameState.quest_lebo_mill_parts_main} = "active"
	[signal arg="objective:Follow two leads — Dumi's contacts and Petrus's stash"]
